From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: St0neWan9 <pawamaba@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:29:04 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: bridge: site icons for the command bar from the
 favicon database or the site's favicon.ico

Plan B132. -[OACProfile fetchSiteIconForPageURL:completionHandler:] answers
the icon of a site the command bar lists but never showed in a tab: the
profile's favicon database first (read only, host fallback), else one GET of
/favicon.ico through the profile's own network context without cookies,
decoded in the sandboxed data decoder and scaled to at most 32 px. No
third-party favicon server is asked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
